{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"15d15e7c268a86d5493db796cf235d921d2395c21e8f4fde46258d2048d9620c"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:1f8844b04bb204344e0022ea0c19b8831e24051c64135ce41f885fdbf324a415","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Paris","evidence":"[D2:5 | 2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023] Gina: Wow, nice spot! Where is it? Got any other features you want to think about before you decide? Paris?! That is really great Jon! Never had a chance to visit it. Been only to Rome once.\n[D15:1 | 10:04 am on 19 June, 2023] Jon: Hey Gina, hope you're doing great! Still working on my biz. Took a short trip last week to Rome to clear my mind a little.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3329604a-66a7-51a1-a2a8-a7aacf3e14e4","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:951cd5a681e4db5bdf27d88c83c5b9a95fec070ed52aa6deed25f7f624e4b6ec","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which city have both Jean and John visited?","referenceAnswer":"Rome","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"951cd5a681e4db5bdf27d88c83c5b9a95fec070ed52aa6deed25f7f624e4b6ec"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}